<title>USA: Sioux Falls feeder cattle steady, light test -USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls feeder cattle steady, light test -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers sold steady in a light test, compared to last Thursday, USDA said. Overall quality not as attractive as previous sale, with an increase in volume number 2 muscle score. 76 percent over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Steers: Medium and Large 1: 550-600 lbs 82.00-82.50, some Blk-Blkwf to 89.50; 600-650 lbs 84.75-86.50; 700-800 lbs 73.00-76.50; 1000-1050 lbs 65.40; 1100-1150 lbs 64.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Medium and Large 1: 500-550 lbs 74.50-80.00; 600-650 lbs 74.50-76.80; 650-700 lbs 68.00-71.10; 750-800 lbs 69.75-71.10; 800-900 lbs 68.10-70.90; 900-950 lbs 63.25 fleshy; 950-1000 lbs 64.10. Receipts: This Week 650  Last Week 1,066  Last Year 1,110</p>
